<title>CHILE: Phelps Dodge Chile 1996 copper output falls.</title>
<headline>Phelps Dodge Chile 1996 copper output falls.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Phelps Dodge's Chilean Candelaria copper mine reported fine copper production falling to 143,000 tonnes last year from 155,844 tonnes in 1995, a spokesman told Reuters.</p>
<p>Company officials declined to comment on the reasons for the slide in output from the mine which lies near the city of Copiapo in Chile's Third Region.</p>
<p>Candelaria is one of few Chilean copper mines to report a fall in production last year.</p>
</text>
